{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id17940008"}, "name":{"label":"W01f_101"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-31T02:50:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.9.2"}, "id":{"label":"9454619832"}, "title":{"label":"Rain radar needs more detail"}, "content":{"label":"The only reason why I cancelled my year’s Premium Ultra subscription is because the rain radar just isn’t detailed enough when compared to Dark Sky (even with this as the source). All Carrot shows is a green blob that misses the smaller showers or detailed fidelity in between a large chunks of rain.  Windy and Met Office are my favourite alternatives for the detail I need now that Dark Sky is no more from today. :(\nI emailed support with screenshots showing the difference, but of the few times I’ve emailed them with questions over the past year, I’ve received no response at all, so that’s another reason for ditching their premium subscription…", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
