{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id101907988"}, "name":{"label":"Monotok"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-30T05:17:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.9.2"}, "id":{"label":"9451349083"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"The app layout, look, customisation, data sources etc are great. However the thing that lets it down for me is the maps. The precipitation is like many apps, low resolution and clunky animations. It’s hard to describe. If you zoom out so you can see all of the uk, go back through the observations, bits of the picture break up, some bits don’t move etc. Some apps like Foreca and the Met office (especially) have an extremely smooth animation and all parts of the image move as they should.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
