{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id317738345"}, "name":{"label":"Boohoo mad"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-26T05:41:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.9.2"}, "id":{"label":"9436670343"}, "title":{"label":"The LEAST boring weather app!"}, "content":{"label":"This is the BEST weather app EVER! It is so fun, and makes checking the weather so much less boring! You can even play mini games, where you have to praise, charge and debug CARROT! I would definitely suggest getting this app, as I am addicted to it!\n\nOne problem with the app is that a lot of customisation features are locked behind a subscription, that you have to pay for monthly. There are still many free things, although some you need the subscription for. \n\nIn conclusion, I would definitely recommend this app, so if you are considering getting it, I would definitely say to go ahead!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
