{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id32716949"}, "name":{"label":"Stirly07"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-20T00:48:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"9415503774"}, "title":{"label":"Actually BETTER than Dark Sky"}, "content":{"label":"Have been searching for a replacement for DS ever since Apple bought it and planned to close it! CARROT is SOOOOO customisable that it takes a while to realise just how powerful it is. Now have my weather set up exactly how I like it, with all the relevant details to me accessible in a fast and easy to read fashion. The hourly details screen is s masterpiece and used extensively when planning long dog walks or golf.\nA truly 5 star app 👍", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id419123104"}, "name":{"label":"marc.uk.76"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-18T14:11:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"9410685351"}, "title":{"label":"Much better than I thought"}, "content":{"label":"My favourite weather app was dark sky as I loved the simple easy to understand layout and was gutted that Apple bought it and are now closing it from January. I looked at all the weather apps but all of them although looked nice lacked the ease of use and clarity of dark sky then I come across Carrot I found I could make it look like my old favourite weather app and even customise it exactly how I want it. It’s great to find a company that understands there customers want the flexibility to design how they want the app to function and I can see why it’s so highly rated and would urge anyone if you like the app to subscribe and support these guys and keep the app going.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
