{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id365321993"}, "name":{"label":"Caralama"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-10-30T23:43:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"9239669039"}, "title":{"label":"Why did I download this?"}, "content":{"label":"Am crying that The Dark Sky’s App is closing down, thought this one would replace it?  It won’t.  It’s awful, feels like a kids App, no weather cloud/lightning radar screen, gives very basic info unless you pay £50 per year.  From what I’ve seen so far?  It’s not even close to being worth it.  Very disappointed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id201948468"}, "name":{"label":"IOnlyReviewWhenIHaveTo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-10-27T11:57:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"9228005780"}, "title":{"label":"Was good"}, "content":{"label":"I bought the app once off back in the day but have since lost access to almost all the features because of the Carrot cash grab business model. Such a shame.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id280069260"}, "name":{"label":"Mikeymikeholden"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-10-27T05:20:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"9226912994"}, "title":{"label":"Great app but very costly."}, "content":{"label":"I subscribed to the 1 week trial after hearing a lot about this app. With Dark Sky being discontinued I needed a good premium replacement. The app itself is well designed and offers something a bit different and I do enjoy using it. However, at a minimum of £20 per year it’s really difficult to justify when there are really good free weather apps out there. The built in Apple app for example now incorporates elements of Dark Sky and is absolutely free. It’s also a really good app. £20 per year is very difficult to justify for a weather app, even a very good one, and something I’m just not prepared to pay.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
