{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id105843414"}, "name":{"label":"innovative_bird"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-10-21T22:27:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"9209267417"}, "title":{"label":"What a novel app"}, "content":{"label":"Had me laughing out to myself as soon as I opened it up and continues to do most times I open it. Not only is it playful, it’s full of information and explains in depth what all the different things within the weather app are. It also had great features like what sort of moon is in the sky, when you can expect to see it and what the name of the current moon is. I don’t think I’ll be getting bored with this anytime soon, I keep finding new and entertaining things on it! The weather is pretty accurate as well - raining all day yesterday, it told me not to go out and that it would see if it could change the forecast for the day as it was dreadful!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
